B.Uh=new A.eX("Cities at Night","When the sun sets, a city changes completely. Office buildings that were full of noise and movement fall quiet, while restaurants and markets nearby begin to fill with people. The streets take on a different rhythm, calmer in some corners and livelier in others.",B.d5)
B.Un=new A.eX("Choosing a Career","Deciding what to do for a living is rarely a single moment of clarity. Most people try a few different paths, discover what they enjoy and what drains them, and slowly adjust their direction. Patience with this process matters more than getting it right immediately.",B.d5)
